{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0387-s001", "text": "När en människa avlider måste familjen och släkten trots sorgen ta itu med många olika saker.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T055627062237Z/hb-c09-u0387-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.279083251953125, "generation_seconds": 31.075079275062308, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0387-s002", "text": "Om dödsfallet har inträffat hemma, ska man i allmänhet ringa nödcentralen, som hänvisar ärendet till en läkare eller till polisen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T055627062237Z/hb-c09-u0387-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.145578231292516, "peak": 0.32366943359375, "generation_seconds": 38.33310183300637, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0387-s003", "text": "Läkaren konstaterar dödsfallet och avgör om orsaken till det är klar eller om en obduktion ska göras av den avlidne.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T055627062237Z/hb-c09-u0387-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.28399658203125, "generation_seconds": 38.99144380283542, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0387-s004", "text": "Om dödsfallet är plötsligt eller inträffar på natten eller på en helg, meddelar man i allmänhet polisen om det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T055627062237Z/hb-c09-u0387-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.36016845703125, "generation_seconds": 38.708634107839316, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0388-s001", "text": "Dödsfall konstateras alltid av läkare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T055627062237Z/hb-c09-u0388-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.4154052734375, "generation_seconds": 15.516463909065351, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0388-s002", "text": "Läkaren ger familjen begravningstillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T055627062237Z/hb-c09-u0388-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.31280517578125, "generation_seconds": 17.554810791043565, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0388-s003", "text": "Läkaren skickar också information om dödsfallet till befolkningsdatasystemet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T055627062237Z/hb-c09-u0388-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.390869140625, "generation_seconds": 27.250753890024498, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0388-s004", "text": "Myndigheterna, såsom FPA, och till exempel den avlidnes bank och arbetspensionsförsäkringsbolag får informationen från befolkningsdatasystemet, men ofta är det ändå bra att kontakta dessa aktörer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T055627062237Z/hb-c09-u0388-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.92734693877551, "peak": 0.415435791015625, "generation_seconds": 56.882223499938846, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0388-s005", "text": "De närstående ska meddela om dödsfallet till den avlidnes eventuella arbetsgivare, till husbolagets disponent och hyresvärden och till bland annat elbolaget och telefonbolaget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060130696693Z/hb-c09-u0388-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.628571428571428, "peak": 0.296356201171875, "generation_seconds": 49.90473207994364, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0389-s001", "text": "En dödsattest är ett dokument som anger orsaken till ett dödsfall.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060130696693Z/hb-c09-u0389-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.409881591796875, "generation_seconds": 21.352306633954868, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0389-s002", "text": "Ibland skriver läkaren dödsattesten först månader efter dödsfallet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060130696693Z/hb-c09-u0389-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.28399658203125, "generation_seconds": 22.435941722942516, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0389-s003", "text": "Familjen behöver inte dödsattesten när de uträttar ärenden hos olika myndigheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060130696693Z/hb-c09-u0389-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.380126953125, "generation_seconds": 27.413731812965125, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0389-s004", "text": "Dödsattesten behövs närmast om familjen måste sköta livförsäkringsärenden för den avlidne.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060130696693Z/hb-c09-u0389-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.34747314453125, "generation_seconds": 32.47896914789453, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0390-s001", "text": "Om dödsorsaken inte är klar, ska den avlidne obduceras.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060130696693Z/hb-c09-u0390-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.29010009765625, "generation_seconds": 24.81169875804335, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0390-s002", "text": "Vid en obduktion tar läkaren reda på varför personen dog.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060130696693Z/hb-c09-u0390-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.30877685546875, "generation_seconds": 20.250287860864773, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0390-s003", "text": "Kroppen kan inte begravas innan dödsorsaken har utretts.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060130696693Z/hb-c09-u0390-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.335296630859375, "generation_seconds": 20.684837175998837, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0390-s004", "text": "En obduktion kan vara medicinsk eller rättsmedicinsk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060550869849Z/hb-c09-u0390-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.9458503401360545, "peak": 0.272857666015625, "generation_seconds": 20.646098115947098, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0391-s001", "text": "En medicinsk utredning av dödsorsak utförs av en läkare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060550869849Z/hb-c09-u0391-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.332061767578125, "generation_seconds": 24.040453783003613, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0391-s002", "text": "En sådan görs om en människas död beror på en sjukdom.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060550869849Z/hb-c09-u0391-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.296234130859375, "generation_seconds": 21.647395020117983, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0391-s003", "text": "Då är en utredning av dödsorsaken till allmän nytta för hälso- och sjukvården.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060550869849Z/hb-c09-u0391-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.373077392578125, "generation_seconds": 22.279507290106267, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0391-s004", "text": "Familjen måste ge sitt tillstånd till medicinsk obduktion.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060550869849Z/hb-c09-u0391-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.3421630859375, "generation_seconds": 20.821540327975526, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0391-s005", "text": "Den kan inte göras utan tillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060550869849Z/hb-c09-u0391-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.2043537414965986, "peak": 0.270782470703125, "generation_seconds": 12.030128655023873, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0392-s001", "text": "Polisen ansvarar för rättsmedicinska utredningar av dödsorsak.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060550869849Z/hb-c09-u0392-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.301025390625, "generation_seconds": 22.68628812697716, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0392-s002", "text": "Polisen beordrar att en rättsmedicinsk obduktion ska utföras om ett dödsfall inte beror på en sjukdom, om det har inträffat plötsligt eller om dödsfallet har inträffat i samband med en olycka, ett brott eller självmord.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060550869849Z/hb-c09-u0392-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 18.320544217687075, "peak": 0.3338623046875, "generation_seconds": 49.07411161996424, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0392-s003", "text": "Polisen behöver inte familjens tillstånd och familjen kan inte vägra obduktionen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060936390542Z/hb-c09-u0392-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.247894287109375, "generation_seconds": 16.626448087161407, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0393-s001", "text": "Organdonation innebär att en människa ger organen och vävnaderna i sin kropp till andra människor efter sin död.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060936390542Z/hb-c09-u0393-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.3994140625, "generation_seconds": 25.66658124490641, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0393-s002", "text": "De donerade organen kan rädda en annan människas liv eller förbättra någons hälsa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060936390542Z/hb-c09-u0393-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.305328369140625, "generation_seconds": 19.729173365980387, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0394-s001", "text": "Enligt finsk lag är varje människa organdonator om hen inte har motsatt sig det medan hen levde.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060936390542Z/hb-c09-u0394-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.26055908203125, "generation_seconds": 23.04029734712094, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0394-s002", "text": "Om man överväger organdonation, försöker läkaren ta reda på vad den avlidnes vilja skulle ha varit i frågan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060936390542Z/hb-c09-u0394-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.316009521484375, "generation_seconds": 29.85586783895269, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0394-s003", "text": "Man antar ändå att personen skulle ha samtyckt till organdonation om man inte känner till att hen varit emot det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060936390542Z/hb-c09-u0394-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.260009765625, "generation_seconds": 29.296412682160735, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0394-s004", "text": "Om en person vill kan hen göra upp ett organdonationstestamente före sin död.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060936390542Z/hb-c09-u0394-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.29925537109375, "generation_seconds": 22.459123883163556, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0394-s005", "text": "Av det framgår personens vilja tydligt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T060936390542Z/hb-c09-u0394-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.31610107421875, "generation_seconds": 13.120569861959666, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0394-s006", "text": "Familjen kan inte vägra organdonation om personen själv har önskat donera sina organ.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T061307604752Z/hb-c09-u0394-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.801904761904762, "peak": 0.292633056640625, "generation_seconds": 24.960623265011236, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0395-s001", "text": "Man kan också testamentera sin kropp till medicinsk forskning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T061307604752Z/hb-c09-u0395-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.3118896484375, "generation_seconds": 20.671257454901934, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0395-s002", "text": "Då måste man underteckna ett avtal där man förbinder sig att ge sin kropp till undervisningsbruk efter döden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-dodsfall/narration-resume-20261103T061307604752Z/hb-c09-u0395-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.281280517578125, "generation_seconds": 28.01288335910067, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
